    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Mythals are sources of immense magic that can alter the Weave or even reality itself. Most were built in ancient times, and many have since been damaged or fallen dormant. As a mythalkeeper from the Dalelands, you likely first encountered a mythal in the ruins of Myth Drannor. You now travel Faerûn seeking other ruined places of power, hoping to learn more about the history and powers of mythals—or even to repair a failing one.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Intelligence, Wisdom, Charisma</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.backgrounds-feats.Item.Kj7f6WGfP8GVfmt1]{Crafter}</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Arcana and History</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulJewelersTo]{Jeweler's Tools}</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbwepQuartersta]{Quarterstaff}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulJewelersTo]{Jeweler's Tools}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagPerfume0000]{Perfume}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagPouch000000]{Pouch}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagRobe0000000]{Robe}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagShovel00000]{Shovel}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagString00000]{String}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagWaterskin00]{Waterskin}, 16 GP; or (B) 50 GP</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
